mapping "W1128.1" source="W1128" target="86591008" relationship=source_is_narrower_than_target quality=100 {
    confidence 0.03 scheme="vocabmod-se-confidence@1"
    comment "en" """
        Source W1128 SNOMED CT 86591008 = Swedish ICD-10-SE extension of W11 (Fall on/from ladder)
        specifying location (skola, annan institution och offentlig lokal) and activity. The base WHO
        code W11 maps via the Athena ICD10->SNOMED CT crosswalk to SNOMED CT 432803 (concept_code 86591008), a
        standard SNOMED CT concept. The Swedish location+activity sub-codes have no equivalent standard
        SNOMED CT representation (the [X]-prefixed ICD-10 cross-map descendants 220463001 etc. are
        themselves non-standard), so the best defensible standard target is the parent concept, which
        fully subsumes every Swedish location/activity variant. high: target is clearly correct,
        one-level broader, crosswalk-verified base.
        """
}
